        "rewrite_notes": "local_fast_path",
        "verdict": "supported",
        "answer": "Samah is an AI Team Lead and AI/ML Engineer with strong full-stack development experience. She builds AI-powered applications, backend APIs, intelligent automation workflows, dashboards, chatbots, document-processing solutions, and modern web platforms.\n\nKey points:\n- Her strongest technical areas include Python backend development, Django, AI and LLM integration, workflow automation, document understanding pipelines, and full-stack solution delivery using Next.js and React.\n- She is strongest in backend development and AI-focused work, though she also works on frontend development for full-stack products.\n- Samah is well-suited for backend and AI-focused projects, especially those involving Django, APIs, LLM integration, automation, and document intelligence.\n- She excels at solving business problems by automating manual workflows, transforming unstructured data into useful structured outputs, and connecting AI with business operations.\n- Samah has built projects such as a live smart electricity dashboard, an auditing employee payroll system, a spend analysis dashboard with AI classification, and an AI property search chatbot.\n- She has leadership experience as an AI Team Lead, which includes technical solution delivery, project ownership, and stakeholder communication.",
